T_tKqSC2CYnCaM1gpme_rZLTTDsgvrHRfOQb8-RbW9KSeRNuJpAPADCkjILKdPX17MVzh2GP3o6nyWGmCMgwPZZ8CoiQQjvGIBDm9IZChom7IDv8fltDp-INisr3HAv7chQmqgH4OzDYubF2rcLWeanROoI0v7D\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh78euRTUOgswqES10o7s0f2zr4WlAw8uhUEQ1ZOcszQXgBsgtLa5CNApJMseoxbAyifYvlLLe2LXZ2INlkqGLthhH7DwRFaYCOuiMsFuD2oP6JpZaNnE7YjfriYheQdf-kzbFnMBQIrRUVXSVcAd_U3yxhrE38fqzEgV7NB4Ic6_dyvxKd5JylQb7MLc8u\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3038\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh78euRTUOgswqES10o7s0f2zr4WlAw8uhUEQ1ZOcszQXgBsgtLa5CNApJMseoxbAyifYvlLLe2LXZ2INlkqGLthhH7DwRFaYCOuiMsFuD2oP6JpZaNnE7YjfriYheQdf-kzbFnMBQIrRUVXSVcAd_U3yxhrE38fqzEgV7NB4Ic6_dyvxKd5JylQb7MLc8u=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Iáu未上課以前，我m̄知影台語beh按怎寫？若雄雄問厝內ê序大人，in mā是頭殼mooh teh燒。有一工， 拄仔好tī網路看著tsit期讀寫班ê報名消息，我想想--leh，一禮拜kan-na上一擺課應該是tsiok輕鬆--ê，suah想bē到開始上課了後，認bat著lán台語文化，tiānn-tiānn hōo我有愈來愈見笑ê感想——為啥mi̍h對家己ê母語tsiah-nī仔生份？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; Ài真感謝阿惠sian-sinn逐禮拜準備tsiah豐富ê教材，hōo我充實智識，上重要--ê是iáu thang熟sāi濟濟tī推廣台語tsit條路繼續堅持ê先進，iáu有逐禮拜二暗時做伙tī線頂練習ê同窗，逐家互相鼓勵求進步。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; 雖然我有時無張持ē làu華語，m̄-koh tsit-má我ē tī生活中ke用台語來表達。上尾，ǹg望家己ē-tàng影響身軀邊ê朋友kah同事，沓沓仔kā家己ê喙舌揣--tńg-來，做一个自由ê台語人。</span></div></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; text-align: left;\"><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi10RzPL1r0HYReHsGye0eDuRyBKDCLJ57vMqDHjPrnDx_EWJp4Cn2qS-4oj_eZsSxDSjLcalOOcubtFCahnMprqZSSeYamKS7-SCD3aWHUQuLp7Z3rFgVXRkEcyd0vdxaBFCIpIK-VBPjLRjeNNkMr9e_6-3GRcxGZvEKqFK1s4pJHyVMwMXimScyOrPqQ\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2129\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi10RzPL1r0HYReHsGye0eDuRyBKDCLJ57vMqDHjPrnDx_EWJp4Cn2qS-4oj_eZsSxDSjLcalOOcubtFCahnMprqZSSeYamKS7-SCD3aWHUQuLp7Z3rFgVXRkEcyd0vdxaBFCIpIK-VBPjLRjeNNkMr9e_6-3GRcxGZvEKqFK1s4pJHyVMwMXimScyOrPqQ=w448-h640\" width=\"448\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl 